==English==
[[File:Front view of a resting Canis lupus ssp.jpg|thumbnail|A wolf.]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|wolf}}, from {{inh|en|ang|wulf}}, {{m|ang|ƿulf}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*wulf}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*wulfaz}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*wĺ̥kʷos}}. 

See also {{cog|stq|Wulf}}, West Frisian and {{cog|nl|wolf}}, {{cog|de|Wolf}}, {{cog|no|-}} and {{cog|da|ulv}}; also {{cog|sa|वृक|tr=vṛ́ka}}, {{cog|fa|گرگ|tr=gorg}}, {{cog|lt|vilkas}}, {{cog|ru|волк}}, {{cog|sq|ujk}}, {{cog|la|lupus}}, {{cog|el|λύκος}}, {{cog|txb|walkwe}}). {{doublet|en|lobo|lupus}}.

